    {
        "id": "dr1041_001-req-001",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "The following policy shall govern the establishment or reestablishment of nonstatutory advisory committees. No such committee shall be established or reestablished unless: (1) It has been determined as a matter of formal record, by the",
