    },
    {
        "id": "dr1041_001-req-063",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(6) Notice of all meetings, both open and closed, shall be published in the Federal Register at least 15, but no more than 45 calendar days prior to the meeting. Shorter notice may be authorized by the Secretariat for good cause or in emergency situations. The reasons",
