    },
    {
        "id": "dr1041_001-req-065",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(7) The agency shall be responsible for preparation of the notice and submitting it to the Federal Register through OGC. The agency shall start processing a meeting notice at least 45 days before the scheduled meeting date to allow for clearance within the Department",
